{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24323","headline":"春尽日天津桥醉吟偶呈李尹侍郎 · 白居易","name":"春尽日天津桥醉吟偶呈李尹侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨洗天津，无泥未有尘。\n初晴迎早夏，落照送残春。\n兴发诗随口，狂来酒寄身。\n水边行嵬峩，桥上立逡巡。\n疎傅心情老，吴公政化新。\n三川徒有主，风景属闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}